      "post_subject": "More muddying of the term",
      "content_md": "And the sad thing is that:\n\n\"Researchers from the University of Cambridge \"\n\ngives it an air of authority!\n\nFor me, warning bells go off when I hear:\n\n' \"The relationship between images and the corresponding holograms is mathematically complex,\" said Cable. \"\n\nIf it really is 'mathematically complex', why bother making a point of stating it without any attempt to state what exactly is so complex? Nothing is so mathematically complex that it can't be explained to make it reasonably comprehensible. Heck, we've covered Bell's Theorem on this forum! But if you want to obfuscate then what you seem to be saying is, \"Trust us. You're too stupid to really understand all this, so just trust us.\"",
